# QA Tool — Git Ignore Rules

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor artifacts
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Packaged builds
*.zip
*.crx

# THE SIGNING KEY — the private half of the manifest "key" that pins this
# extension's ID. NEVER COMMIT. It lives outside this folder on purpose
# (alongside the analyser's, at the SOTI-AI-Analyser root) so it cannot be
# swept into this repository by accident, and this rule is the backstop for
# the day somebody copies it in "just to keep them together".
#
# What it is for: publishing a .crx under the same ID. The ID itself comes
# from the PUBLIC half, which is in manifest.json and is meant to be there.
# Losing this file costs the ability to sign a .crx, nothing else.
*.pem

# Backups the tool writes
QA Tool backup *.json
